        "TileImage": "$($repository d0c2aa29-763e-45dc-a8fb-41d05322de9e).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your target is Charlie Burke, one of Alma Reynard&apos;s bodyguards. He and another bodyguard have been posted around a car along the beach. \r\rMr. Burke is an author, immersing himself in the job for his next book. However, it isn&apos;t the only thing he is writing. He has managed to aquire information that could destroy the reputation of countless companies around the globe. He plans to publish it tomorrow, so now is our only chance.\r\rGood luck, 47.\r\r I will leave you to prepare.",
